This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
expresses NIST Special Publication 800-115, "Technical Guide to Information Security Testing
and Assessment", as a grounded IDD graph so consuming projects can compose it with
throughline-compose.

NIST SP 800-115 is a publication of the U.S. National Institute of Standards and Technology
and is a work of the U.S. federal government; as such it is in the public domain in the
United States and may be freely reproduced and derived. The content restated here is derived
from that publication; each item's attrs.source_ref cites the relevant section. NIST does not
endorse this repository. The authoritative document is available from NIST at
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/115/final.
